Package: sedir-base-files
Version: @SEDIR_RELEASE@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: The SedirOS Authors <ahmetatakan.tech@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: required
Depends: base-files
Description: SedirOS release identification
 Identifies the system as SedirOS @SEDIR_RELEASE@ (based on Debian
 @SEDIR_CODENAME@) through /usr/lib/os-release. ID_LIKE=debian keeps tools
 that look for Debian working.
 .
 Debian's os-release is kept as /usr/lib/os-release.debian (dpkg-divert)
 and restored when this package is removed.
